flowchart LR
    CAP[Device capture] --> RAW[Raw multichannel AudioView]
    RAW --> CAL[Channel routing + calibration]
    CAL --> ODAS[ODAS / spatial branch]

    RAW --> SMAP[Speech channel selection/calibration]
    PLAY[Pre-DAC playback reference] --> AEC[WebRTC AEC3]
    SMAP --> AEC
    AEC --> RS[Resampler]
    RS --> SPEECH[Enhancement / VAD / ASR]
